  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - Nahkriin unleashes an ancient and mighty magic.
  - Nahkriin locally increases gravity, dragging multicolored fire toward {mc}.
  - Nahkriin rains down a snowstorm.
  - Nahkriin fires several beams of lightning.
  - Nahkriin tries to aim his lightning with more care.
  - Nahkriin unleashes lightning bolts and arcing fireballs, which {mc} tries to
    block.
  - Nahkriin flings out splitting ice spikes.
  - Nahkriin freezes {mc}'s feet and projects large snow clouds.
  - Nahkriin unleashes more arcing fireballs.
  randomAttacks:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7620dc894f2699a46b2d4662c93fcacb, type: 2}
