  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Nahkriin summons multiple columns of fire.
  - Nahkriin rains down hell-fire from above.
  - Nahkriin flings out fireballs and snowballs.
  - Nahkriin rains down orange fire from above.
  - Nahkriin rains down blue fire from above.
  - Nahkriin drags multicolored fire towards {mc}.
  - Nahkriin unleashes a heavy snow storm.
  - Nahkriin fires beams of frost and splitting ice spikes.
  - Nahkriin freezes {mc}'s feet with a beam of ice, and tries to freeze his head!
  maxHealth: 220
