  enemyPrefab: {fileID: 1745643679205403353, guid: b9adf4b23e35c664ab5cb52d08b95459, type: 3}
  defeatText: With Nahkriin defeated, {mc} picks up the staff to reopen the portal
    to Sovngarde.
  nameText: Nahkriin
  blurbText: It's funny that we've seen the two dragon priests that don't spawn in
    a coffin, eh? Also, if you forget to grab his mask, you won't be able to get
    it without console or exploits.
